M221 S100 ;Set the flow rate to 100%
M104 S140 ;Start heating extruder
M190 S80 ;Wait for the bed to reach print temp
G90
G28 ;home
G1 Z10 F300
G1 X67.5 Y0 F6000
G1 Z0 F300
M109 S245 ;Wait for extruder to reach print temp
G92 E0 ;Reset Extruder
